    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T22:55:39Z",
    "body": "We used an offline VM running a copy of our Agie Classic Cut 2S machine control. We imported the CAMCraft punch with a reentrant notch. GRAFICHECK preserved the notch on all four passes. The plotted apex positions matched the intersections of the offset faces. FORMALCHECK reported zero job errors.\n\nAll controller runs were offline. No physical cut was made.\n",
